; soak-torture: the soak's raw load on the drop-in: checked random I/O on
; units 1-3, 8 kids at priority -5 (below the remote shells at -2, so the two
; soak-fs jobs keep running), two rounds of 900 s; then the stop file that
; ends the soak-fs jobs.
FailAt 30
RAM:vscsitest TORTURE virtioscsi.device 900 1,2,3 8 -5 >SHARED:sbench/soak/torture.txt
Date >SHARED:sbench/soak/end.txt
Echo "stop" >SHARED:sbench/soak/stop
